  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_covercle_cbd8bc25ede6267d2d6450b4832fc30894065aadf77b3f12738724732d4898a480">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>Covers for the opening at the top of a vessel or other receptacle, or which close the mouth of an aperture; lids may be detached or turned upon a hinge in order to give access to the interior. [Source: Getty AAT]</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
